#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:1
msgid "H2 MC Solvation"
msgstr "H2 MC 溶剂化"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial introduces the `q2m3.solvation` API with the maintained fixed-mode H2 Monte Carlo "
"example. It is the recommended MC smoke path."
msgstr "本教程使用维护中的 fixed 模式 H2 蒙特卡洛示例介绍 `q2m3.solvation` API。这是建议的 MC 冒烟测试路径。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:6
msgid "Run The Script"
msgstr "运行脚本"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:12
msgid ""
"The script builds a `SolvationConfig`, runs `run_solvation()`, and reports whether the Catalyst "
"IR cache was a hit or miss."
msgstr "脚本构建 `SolvationConfig`，运行 `run_solvation()`，并报告 Catalyst IR 缓存是否命中。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:15
msgid "Configuration Pattern"
msgstr "配置用法"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:50
msgid "Fixed Mode"
msgstr "Fixed 模式"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:52
msgid ""
"`fixed` mode uses a vacuum QPE Hamiltonian and adds MM energy terms during the MC loop. It is the"
" fastest public MC path. Use it to test Catalyst, JAX, PySCF, and the IR cache together."
msgstr "`fixed` 模式使用真空 QPE 哈密顿量，并在 MC 循环中添加 MM 能量项。它是最快的公开 MC 路径，可同时测试 Catalyst、JAX、PySCF 和 IR 缓存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:56
msgid ""
"The first run can compile Catalyst IR. Later runs can reuse cached IR if the circuit structure is"
" unchanged."
msgstr "首次运行可能编译 Catalyst IR。如果电路结构不变，后续运行可复用缓存的 IR。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:59
msgid "Output Fields"
msgstr "输出字段"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:61
msgid ""
"The result dictionary includes energy trajectories, acceptance statistics, timing data, circuit "
"metadata, and optional cache statistics. Diagnostics can add result keys. Code that reads results"
" should use `.get()` for optional metadata."
msgstr "结果字典包含能量轨迹、接受统计、计时数据、电路元数据和可选缓存统计。诊断可能增加结果键。读取结果的代码应使用 `.get()` 获取可选元数据。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:66
msgid "Memory Notes"
msgstr "内存说明"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.md:68
msgid ""
"Use H2 fixed mode for the first MC run. H3O+ and dynamic mode increase Hamiltonian term count, "
"circuit size, and Catalyst compile cost. Treat them as diagnostics until the H2 path is "
"validated."
msgstr "首次 MC 运行使用 H2 fixed 模式。H3O+ 和 dynamic 模式会增加哈密顿量项数、电路大小及 Catalyst 编译成本。在 H2 路径验证通过前，将它们视为诊断。"
